                %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} \Omega_0 \xrightarrow{\Gamma_t(U | \bullet)} [0,1]
            is a measurable function.
          %p
            To say that the stochastic process is indivisible means that for any
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
