            = succeed "," do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/decoherence"} decoherence
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/entanglement"} entanglement
            arise within the framework of indivisible
            = succeed "." do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/stochastic+processes"} stochastic processes
          %h2#history History
          %p
            The development of the indivisible stochastic interpretation of quantum systems is due to
            = succeed "." do
